  "idea": "Baserow: the completely free open-source Airtable alternative",
  "text": "This open-source database gives you unlimited rows and custom relational views for free. Operations managers struggle when spreadsheet formulas lag, yet upgrading database software costs thousands. Clunky spreadsheets corrupt formulas while commercial SaaS tools charge steep fees for every single team collaborator. Baserow runs on PostgreSQL, offering lightning-fast Kanban views, formulas, and developer APIs without seat licenses. Your team tracks inventory and projects effortlessly.",
